<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Brazilian soccer championship quarter-final, first leg matches played Wednesday.</p>
<p> Goias	     3   Guarani	  1</p>
<p> Portuguesa	3   Cruzeiro	 0</p>
<p>Playing Thursday: Gremio v Palmeiras, Atletico Mineiro v Atletico Paranaense.</p>
